<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Duratex H1 net rises vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Duratex H1 net rises vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian textile firm Duratex S.A. reported the following first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>Net		    18.9 million	    12.4 million</p>
<p>Gross Revs	  325.2 million	   276.1 million</p>
<p>Net Revs	    257.7 million	   221.2 million</p>
<p>Gross Profit	 74.3 million	    54.97 million</p>
<p>Oper Net	     29.9 million	    17.6 million</p>
<p>Pre-tax Profit     28.8 million	    19.8 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
